<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Swiss Bank basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Swiss Bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 20 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Swiss bank shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of UBS, Swiss Bank Corp and CS Group. One basket is controlled by 500 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5,500 CHF		 PREMIUM	20.52 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.10 CHF		  GEARING	9.13 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY	  19.MAR.99		 PAYDATE	24.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  5,020 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
